  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description\">\n  <p class=\"product-summary\">This small patchwork shoulder bag is crafted of the leather and cotton denim scraps left over from the making of Coach bags. Designed to sit neatly under your arm, it features a detachable shoulder strap and a secures with a zip-top closure that keeps everyday essentials close—keys, phone, wallet, and more. Each bag may feature variations in color or print. It will continue to develop more character over time.</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"product-highlights\">\n    <h4>Product Specifications</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Material:</strong> Main: Denim and leather scraps</li>\n      <li><strong>Lining:</strong> Lining: Recycled polyester</li>\n      <li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip-top closure</li>\n      <li><strong>Organization:</strong> Inside slip pocket</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top: 15px; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px;\">\n    <summary style=\"font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;\">📏 Size & Measurement Guide</summary>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n      <tbody>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Dimensions (L x H x W)</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">N/A</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Handle Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">N/A</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Shoulder / Crossbody Strap Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Detachable short strap with 10.4&quot; drop</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </details>\n</div>",
